        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Also locating control within an EV has two varieties, one is manual driving by customer with indication of difference information from target position, and another is auto parking function. Target position consists of device position within a parking lot and install offset within vehicle frame. Vehicle frame is defined as enveloping square to vehicle outline. These values are exchanged as ones of service parameter lists. Usually these requires calibration with registration to EVSEs in advance.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                243,
