        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "As for vehicle check out, main object is to inform EVSE of EV departure and vacant parking lot. It seems to be considered necessary for the EVSE detect vacation of EV without dedicated devices for it. Recently such devices have become more popular, so that this service is confirmed by them in some cases.",
